dams:Mapping a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:comment """Явное соответствие между элементами. Discriminate via mapping_type: realizes (solution→enterprise conceptual), entity_physical (PhysicalObject↔LogicalEntity), field_mapping/mapsTo (physical↔logical), aligns_with (enterprise↔external term). Not used for SpecImpl implements/conforms_to.
""" ;
